WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.390
Kanemayu akufotokoza momwe angagwiritsire ntchito Arclight kupanga fundal red reflex posankha kuwala kowala kwambiri.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.650
Onetsetsani kuti choyikamo cha lens chili pamwamba, pomwe palibe mphamvu ya lens pabowo lowonera.

3
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.010
Pa utali wa mkono, onani reflex m'maso onse nthawi imodzi.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.750
Fananizani kuwala ndi mtundu pakati pa maso awiriwa.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.290
Pakuwunika kwabwinobwino, pasakhale kusiyana kwakukulu pakuwala ndi mtundu pakati pa maso awiriwo.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.120
Mu makanda oyera ndi aku Asia, reflex imatha kuwoneka lalanje komanso yachikasu.

7
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.500
Maonekedwe awa akadali abwinobwino popeza mtundu wonse ndi kuwala kumakhala kofanana pakati pa maso awiriwo.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.980
Kuwoneka kwachilendo ndi pamene pali kusiyana kosalekeza, kwenikweni pakuwala ndi mtundu pakati pa maso awiriwo.

9
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:10.890
Izi zitha kukhala mawonekedwe a cornea osasunthika, chigamba chakuda chomwe chili mkati mwa diso limodzi kapena maso onse onse, kapena kusakhalapo kofiira.

10
00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:25.670
Kuyeza kwa reflex kosazolowereka kumatha kuwonetsa kukhalapo kwa ng'ala, retinoblastoma, chilonda cha cornea, squint, kapena cholakwika cha refractive.

11
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.970
Zonsezi zimafuna kuunika kwinanso ndi katswiri.
